{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-habtoor-grand-residences","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"habtoor-grand-residences","about":"Step into a world of exclusivity at the Habtoor Grand Residences in Dubai Marina, a prestigious project by Al Habtoor Group. Spanning 50 levels with a ground floor, this development is a testament to luxury and elegance. Choose from an exquisite range of 2 to 4-bedroom apartments, 3 to 4-bedroom townhouses, and expansive 5-bedroom penthouses. Each home in Habtoor Grand Residences boasts stunning views of the sparkling sea, Bluewaters Island, Palm Jumeirah, and the scenic Dubai Marina, with sizes ranging from 2,023 sq. ft to a generous 6,738 sq. ft. Experience grandeur with roomy interiors and mesmerizing sea vistas. The residents can also enjoy access to the exceptional amenities of Al Habtoor Grand Resort. Conveniently situated near King Salman Bin Abdulaziz Al Saud St, Habtoor Grand Residences Address provides excellent connectivity across the emirate and direct beach access, making Habtoor Grand Residences a crown jewel in the realm of Al Habtoor City real estate development.","price":11000000,"title":"Habtoor Grand Residences","bitrix":{"id":316,"pf_id":"are.2.13406","source":null,"project_id":"Habtoor Grand Residences","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Habtoor Grand Residences","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Al Habtoor","project_location":"Dubai Marina"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/habtoor_grand_feature_e22d9c3d2c.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/habtoor_grand_feature_e22d9c3d2c.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0787158,"lng":55.1393112},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/habtoor_grand_9_e73330a2e9.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/habtoor_grand_9_e73330a2e9.